# Web app build output and its staging tree for the Go embed: never
# committed. `make web-build` rebuilds web/build from source and stages
# the copy into server/internal/web/dist; CI and local Go builds run it
# first (a Go build without it fails at the embed directive).
web/build/
web/node_modules/
server/internal/web/dist/

